<title>POLAND: Poland mulls slower zloty devaluation-finmin Belka.</title>
<headline>Poland mulls slower zloty devaluation-finmin Belka.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland is considering a slower pace of monthly zloty devaluation to help curb inflation, Polish Finance Minister Marek Belka told Reuters Financial Television in an interview on Thursday.</p>
</text>
